"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"A single, real-time screen for the receptionist, built on the\n"
"vertical-hotel data model (``vertical_hotel``, ``hotel_reservation``,\n"
"``hotel_housekeeping``). No new master data or workflow is introduced;\n"
"every figure is read live from existing records:\n"
"\n"
"- Occupancy right now (occupied / available rooms)\n"
"- Rooms ready to sell, split from rooms needing housekeeping and rooms\n"
"  whose last housekeeping predates the last check-out (not confirmed\n"
"  since)\n"
"- In-house guest count\n"
"- What is still left this shift: arrivals not yet in, departures not yet\n"
"  out, and departures already overdue\n"
"- Same-day turnovers, with the housekeeping deadline per room\n"
"- Today's arrivals and departures, with the balance due on departures\n"
"- Folios checking out today with something still to pay\n"
"- Restaurant orders not yet charged to a folio that leaves today (only\n"
"  when ``hotel_restaurant`` is installed)\n"
"- Confirmed reservations that never became a folio\n"
"- Quick lookup by guest name, room number or folio number\n"
"\n"
"Every figure is a drill-down: clicking a tile opens the records it was\n"
"counted from, and the arrival / departure rows open their folio.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Open *Hotel > Dashboard* (hotel users).\n"
"\n"
"- Click a tile, or one of the small figures inside it, to open the\n"
"  records it counts; the arrival, departure and turnover rows open their\n"
"  folio or room.\n"
"- Type a guest name, a folio number or a room number in the search box\n"
"  to find the folio.\n"
"- The screen refreshes itself every minute; *Auto* switches that off and\n"
"  *Refresh* reloads it at once.\n"
"\n"
"A room is *ready to sell* when its latest housekeeping job is done\n"
"(inspected) after the last guest left; a room cleaned but not inspected\n"
"yet, or still dirty, *needs housekeeping*.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/vertical-hotel/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/vertical-hotel/issues/new?body=module:%20hotel_front_desk_dashboard%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
